                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Donald Trump has put healthcare on the ropes. More than ever, this is the time for us to support all of our nurses and healthcare professionals in California. That\u2019s the only way we\u2019ll keep our families healthy and safe. \u00a0\n\nI firmly believe Kaiser and @unacuhcp nurses and healthcare professionals can finish the job of reaching a new contract that hits the mark on wages and working conditions.\u00a0Here in California, we believe in collective bargaining and a fair process.",
