                "text": "Today, I was proud to join @unacuhcp nurses and healthcare professionals on the picket line.\n\nAs Californians, we believe in collective bargaining and defend workers\u2019 rights.\n\nLet\u2019s stand with our healthcare professionals. It\u2019s time for Kaiser and UNAC/UHCP to finish a new contract that improves wages and working conditions.",
